    <string name="sync_how_to_pair">On the computer open Tetra › Phone sync › Pair a phone, then scan the code it shows. The connection is checked against that code every time.</string>
    <string name="sync_what_a_sync_does">A sync copies each photo, video and file the other device does not have yet, in whichever directions the computer\'s rules allow, into the same folders. Both sides check every file by SHA-256 before keeping it, and nothing is ever deleted on either side because of a sync.</string>
